    "title": "Accelerator shell on a host card (regression fixture)",
    "caption": "Overview view of the whole accelerator kernel (scope: top). The host programs control registers over AXI4-Lite; a memory mover is the AXI4 master to external card memory; input and output bytes also travel as AXI4-Stream interfaces through an input select and an output FIFO. Open arrowheads: stream interfaces (valid/ready); dashed: control.",
